        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I had a Mesolift treatment with Nesrine at Dermka Clinic — she was amazing! Very professional, kind, and explained everything clearly. My skin looks brighter and feels great. Highly recommend her and the clinic!",
        "time": 1761401249,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cycy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103726728665084308261/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLM3XZBrUxfoL22BUrvQThkNdIZhQn3U6Pr-dP4rxqfB-JdPU4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an incredible experience at Dermka Clinik! The staff was professional, friendly, and attentive from start to finish. The clinic has a welcoming atmosphere, and the team truly took the time to understand my concerns and provide personalized care. The treatments were cutting-edge, and the results exceeded my expectations. I felt confident and comfortable throughout the entire process. Highly recommend Dermka Clinik for anyone seeking expert skincare and a fantastic overall experience!",
        "time": 1729771574,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Lascano",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102815135408089419562/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVxzCEHWYHVx8fY65UQK1_sYxn5R4X-fjc5ZmZivZ0jDFByyDq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I went to this clinic for a face treatment because my company gave me a gift card.\nThe esthetician was good doing the procedure. She mentioned they could offer some treatments for my skin condition that could help a lot. She seemed very positive and excited about improving my skin.\nI appreciated the excitement; however, I mentioned my budget was very limited and that was the reason why I have never had any treatment in the past.\nShe explained to me the procedures she would recommend and showed me the prices. As I’m well aware of what my budget limit is, I declined the offer because I simply didn’t have the budget for it.\nShe continued offering me different options, but they were out of my budget until she made me an offer that was very close to what I could afford so it was an offer impossible to reject.\nShe was showing me the different offers in post-its so I asked her for a piece of paper and a pen to write down her offer and the payment plan. We looked at it together and agreed. I made the first prepayment that day.\nWhen I came back for my first treatment, she proceeds with the treatment, and she started upselling me products. I didn’t like that at all. It was a bit hard for me to get the budget for the offer she made me, so I felt really uncomfortable when she started trying to sell other procedures.\nWhen we finished, I went to made my second prepayment according to the plan she offered me. She started again trying to sell me more procedures. As I mentioned again my budget was limited and that the only thing I could afford was the plan we agreed on, she proceeded to show me an “ official document” with all my procedures including an extra payment and no reductions at all. She showed me the total and it was higher than what we discussed. I’m sure of that because I know exactly what my budget was and what would be too high for me to pay. When I mentioned that, she just said “but ma’am those are the prices of the procedures, this is what we discussed” I was sure it wasn’t, and I told her she never showed me that “official document”, so I never agreed on it. I felt so disappointed. I felt she just offered me the “discount” just to get me hooked and she probably thought after the first treatment she could just change the price back and I would not notice. I felt I was just a client to push as many treatments as possible. I couldn’t trust anymore if those procedures were good for me, or she was just trying to sell everything she had. I left the place and will not go back. Also, I wouldn’t recommend this place as it’s hard for me to know now if what they offer to you is what fits you needs or it’s just an opportunity to sell as many procedures as possible regardless.",
        "time": 1717081737,
        "translated": false
      },
